#: scenario8:scenario8_C81F0E3B_6618_46FA_9D91_E6701D26E623
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e1311c0e365d24385c4bbcdba99f5720b9fd6b08ad0b485c1a7838ada0c38b0
